ay in 2026, and how to use AI to earn more rather than be replaced by it.</p></div><div class="pb"><div class="pi">🛠️</div><h3>AI Tool Reviews</h3><p>Honest, side-by-side comparisons of ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and 50+ other tools — tested on real Indian work tasks.</p></div><div class="pb"><div class="pi">💰</div><h3>Money &amp; Property</h3><p>SIP vs real estate, tax-saving frameworks, and how to build ₹1 crore by 40. All numbers are India-specific. All advice is actionable.</p></div></div><h2>Why You Can Trust Us</h2><div class="tr"><div class="ti">🔬 Every article is factually verified before publishing</div><div class="ti">🇮🇳 100% India-specific data and examples</div><div class="ti">🚫 We never publish paid opinions as editorial</div><div class="ti">🔗 Affiliate links always clearly disclosed</div><div class="ti">📋 Financial advice always paired with a SEBI disclaimer</div></div><h2>Our Editorial Standards</h2><div class="tp"><h3>📌 Our 3-Step Publishing Promise</h3><p>Every article goes through: (1) factual research from primary sources, (2) real-world testing or data verification, and (3) a plain-language edit so a busy professional can act on it in under 10 minutes. We never publish clickbait. We never let affiliate relationships influence what we recommend.</p></div><p>All financial content on FutureProof Blog carries a disclaimer reminding readers to consult a SEBI-registered advisor before making investment decisions. We are not SEBI-registered financial advisors — we are researchers and writers who believe in sharing what the data actually says.</p><div class="cb"><h2>Join Indian Professionals Reading FutureProof</h2><p>Get our free guide: "The 10 AI Tools Every Indian Professional Needs in 2026" — plus weekly insights on AI, careers and wealth, straight to your inbox.</p><a href="/subscribe" class="btn">Get the Free Guide →</a></div><h2>Contact Us</h2><div class="cl"><span style="font-size:1.5rem">✉️</span><div><p>Have a question, a story tip, or a topic you